# State machine (`dondron_state_machine`)

Library: **BehaviorTree.CPP v4** (Nav2-compatible patterns).

## Public mission flow (M2 — `behavior_trees/mission.xml`)

```
Arm → EnableOffboard → WaitOffboard → ClimbToAltitude → ExecuteSearchPattern
  → TargetAcquired + TrackTarget
```

**TRACK** is the public terminal state (visual lock in BT only). ENGAGE / closed-loop flight lives in private repo Line 2+.

## DISENGAGE

- **Not** BT-initiated — PX4 `COM_RC_OVERRIDE` handles RC stick override
- BT monitors flight mode via bridged `/fmu/out/vehicle_status_v4` (param `vehicle_status_topic`)
- M2 `mission.xml`: flat sequence — no auto-RTL subtree on failure; node halts on FAILURE

## BT structure (M2)

```
Root (ReactiveSequence)
├── Condition: RC_Override_Not_Active
└── Sequence (autonomous_mission)
     ├── Action: Arm
     ├── Action: EnableOffboard
     ├── Action: WaitOffboard
     ├── Action: ClimbToAltitude
     ├── Action: ExecuteSearchPattern
     └── ReactiveSequence (acquire_loop)
          ├── Condition: TargetAcquired
          └── Action: TrackTarget
```

## Public boundary

- `TargetAcquired` / `TrackTarget` read `/detections` only — no bbox→setpoint mapping
- Search/climb publish generic setpoints via `/flight_api/cmd_setpoint`
- No ENGAGE actions in `mission.xml`

